id: cage-of-light
name: Cage of Light
uaType: technical
prerequisite: Force or Magic Score 10+, Insight Score 8+
tpCost: 16
type: standard
# "All of your remaining Actions (Min. 2)".
actionCost: 2
spendsAllActions: true
kiCostPerTier: 10
# Applied when used, and "at the start of each of your turns, you may spend all of your Actions and pay the KP Cost of
# Cage of Light to maintain the Cage" - paid on its own with a Stop on the card (chat.mjs upkeepUniques). "You can remove
# the Cage as an Instant Action" - from its row's Applied.
sustained: true
upkeepAllActions: true
instantRelease: true
# "Create a Large Sphere AoE centered on your chosen Square."
sphereMagnitude: large
# Who is inside is the table's (the user's ruling): the Life Point reductions and the Might Clash to enter or leave are
# buttons under its entry, at the one targeted.
cage: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Large Sphere Cage within 8 Squares: dodging inside costs 1/4 of your Might in Life Points, reaching its edge double
  your Might, crossing it a Might Clash. All your Actions and its KP each turn keep it.
text: >
  Cage of Light: You create a trap for your enemies of pure energy, keeping some inside, and some outside.
  –Ability Type: Technical
  –Prerequisites: Force or Magic Score 10+, Insight Score 8+
  –TP Cost: 16
  –KP Cost: 10(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: All of your remaining Actions (Min. 2)
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Target a Square within 8 Squares of you. Create a Large Sphere AoE centered on your chosen Square, this is
  known as the Cage. Characters within the Cage have their Life Points reduced by 1/4 (rounded up) of your Might
  whenever they would successfully dodge an Attacking Maneuver.

  Characters within the Cage cannot move outside of the Cage, and Characters outside of the Cage cannot move into the
  Cage, and will cease movement on a Square adjacent to the perimeter of the Cage. Any Character that moves onto an
  adjacent Square to the perimeter of the Cage has their Life Points reduced by double your Might.

  Characters can attempt to enter or exit the Cage when using the Movement Maneuver (they still suffer the reduction to
  Life Points listed above) by making a Might Clash against you. If they win, they enter/exit the Cage.

  At the start of each of your turns, you may spend all of your Actions and pay the KP Cost of Cage of Light to maintain
  the Cage. If you choose not to, the Cage will disappear.

  You cannot use this Unique Ability while a Cage is active but you can remove the Cage as an Instant Action.
